{
  "notes": "Synthwave, A minor, 100 BPM. Chorused analog chords (SYN BRASS) that pump in eighths, a fat TRIO bass driving in eighths with octave pops (sixteenths in the lift), the player's chiptune lead on the Smart Keys (GAME LEAD with vibrato and an eighth-note echo), and the SYNTHWV kit with its big snare. Scenes: A holds i and VII; B cruises on i v VI VII; C rises through VI VII III v with a sixteenth-note arpeggio on the chord track and a sixteenth bass; D holds VI and iv in a longer reverb with the bass filtered down. ENERGY: chords only, then kick and bass, then snare and eighth hats with the full pulse, then sixteenth hats, open hats and fills. All material is original.",
